<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>四诗对比 · 脚步 / 孤独国 / 崖上 / 水仙花</title>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/p5@1.9.0/lib/p5.min.js"></script>
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html, body { margin:0; height:100%; background:#050510; overflow:hidden;
               font-family:"PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif; color:#ddd; }
  .app { display:flex; height:100vh; }
  .scene { flex:0 0 52%; position:relative; overflow:hidden; }
  .scene canvas { display:block; }
  .panel { flex:1; background:#08081a; border-left:1px solid #1a1a30;
           padding:16px 20px 40px; overflow-y:auto; }
